  "instructions": "Call parcel_auth_status first when credential state is unknown. Use parcel_list_deliveries for recent or active tracking data and parcel_list_carriers before adding a delivery. Parcel returns cached tracking data and does not refresh a carrier on demand. The add endpoint accepts one delivery per request and has a 20-request daily limit, including failures. Write tools are hidden. Set PARCEL_ALLOW_WRITES=1 or grant write access in the hosted connector.",
